# AI SDR Automation with n8n

> An AI-powered sales development workflow that researches leads, evaluates opportunities, and prepares personalized outreach.

## Overview

This project demonstrates an automated AI SDR workflow built with **n8n**.

The system receives a new lead through a webhook, validates the information, analyzes the company, evaluates the lead and generates personalized outreach.

The goal is to reduce repetitive sales research and preparation.

## Architecture

```text
Lead
  ↓
Webhook
  ↓
Input Validation
  ↓
Company Research
  ↓
AI Analysis
  ↓
Lead Scoring
  ↓
Personalized Outreach
  ↓
CRM / Database
  ↓
Email
```

## Features

• Webhook-based lead intake

• Lead data validation

• Company research

• AI-based lead analysis

• Lead scoring

• Pain point identification

• Personalized outreach generation

• Structured output

• CRM or database storage

• Email automation

