## Workflow

### 1. Webhook

The workflow starts when a new lead is submitted.

### 2. Validation

Required fields are checked before processing.

### 3. Research

The system gathers available company information.

### 4. AI Analysis

An LLM analyzes the available information and identifies possible business needs.

### 5. Lead Scoring

The lead receives a structured score based on predefined criteria.

### 6. Outreach Generation

The AI creates a personalized outreach message using the lead information and identified opportunity.

### 7. Storage

The lead and generated information can be stored in a CRM or database.

### 8. Email

The generated message can be passed to an email provider for outreach.

